docs {
  # Output API

  Endpoints untuk manajemen master data Output (jenis luaran penelitian/pengabdian).

  **Base URL:** `/api/outputs`

  ---

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | GET | `/` | List semua output | ✅ | All |
  | GET | `/options` | Dropdown options output | ✅ | All |
  | POST | `/` | Tambah output baru | ✅ | create_output |
  | GET | `/:id` | Detail output | ✅ | All |
  | PUT | `/:id` | Update output | ✅ | edit_output |
  | DELETE | `/:id` | Hapus output | ✅ | delete_output |
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}
